---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const COMPASS_URL = 'https://redefiningretirement.io/products/the-gen-exit-compass';
---

<Layout
  title="You're In | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Your Gen eXit Playbook is on the way. Here's the next step for $7."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
  bare={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <h1 class="ty-headline">Your Playbook is on the way. Here's the next step for $7.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section oto-section">
    <div class="container prose oto-prose">
      <p>The Playbook covers the shift from defense to offense and the 5 plays for building income beside your job. What it doesn't do is tell you which direction is yours. That's the part most of us get stuck on.</p>

      <p>The Gen eXit Compass is the workbook I use for that. It normally sells for $27. Since you just grabbed the Playbook, use the code below and it's $7.</p>

      <p>Do it in one sitting. You walk away with a direction on paper, not a vague feeling.</p>

      <img
        class="compass-cover"
        src="/images/compass/gen-exit-compass-cover.jpg"
        alt="The Gen eXit Compass workbook cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />

      <p><strong>What's inside:</strong></p>

      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>7 plug-in AI prompts that run your 25 years of experience through a real process. No blank page.</li>
        <li>The AI Rory Test, so you aim at work AI can't easily replace.</li>
        <li>The Ikigai Intersection: where what you're good at, what you like, what's needed and what pays overlap.</li>
        <li>3 demand-checked opportunities, ranked by which one you can test fastest.</li>
        <li>Bonus: a fill-in "My North Star" page.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="code-callout">
        <p class="code-callout-head">Use code <span class="promo-code">PLAYBOOK7</span> at checkout.</p>
        <p>Click "Add promotion code" in the cart, enter PLAYBOOK7, and the price drops from $27 to $7.</p>
      </div>

      <p>Not useful? Email <a href="mailto:coreysretirement@fastmail.com">coreysretirement@fastmail.com</a> and I'll refund you. No questions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-block oto-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-cta" href={COMPASS_URL} id="compass-cta-btn">Get the Compass for $7</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];

    // Fire on page load — this page is only reachable via Beehiiv signup redirect.
    // Used by Meta Pixel - Lead in GTM (avoids race condition with signedUp + redirect).
    window.dataLayer.push({ event: 'subscriber_signup_confirmed' });

    // Carry UTM + fbclid params through to the Beehiiv checkout link.
    var btn = document.getElementById('compass-cta-btn');
    if (btn) {
      var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      var passthrough = new URLSearchParams();
      params.forEach(function (value, key) {
        if (key.indexOf('utm_') === 0 || key === 'fbclid' || key === 'gclid') {
          passthrough.append(key, value);
        }
      });
      if ([...passthrough].length) {
        var url = new URL(btn.href);
        passthrough.forEach(function (value, key) { url.searchParams.set(key, value); });
        btn.href = url.toString();
      }

      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        window.dataLayer.push({
          event: 'begin_checkout',
          ecommerce: {
            currency: 'USD',
            value: 7,
            items: [{ item_id: 'gen-exit-compass', item_name: 'The Gen eXit Compass', price: 7, quantity: 1 }],
          },
        });
      });
    }
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .code-callout {
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 2px dashed var(--blue);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .code-callout p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .code-callout-head {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .promo-code {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .ty-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ty-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ty-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ty-subhead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .oto-section {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .oto-prose {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .oto-badge {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .oto-headline {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quiz-block {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .quiz-block ul {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .quiz-answer {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .intro-label {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  .intro-headline {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .product-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .compass-cover {
    max-width: 280px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .check-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .check-list li {
    padding-left: 1.6rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .check-list li::before {
    content: '✅';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
  }

  .price-reveal {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .oto-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .price-line {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .price-was {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .price-now {
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .btn-cta {
    height: 56px;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cta-trust {
    margin-top: 0.85rem !important;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .testimonial-block {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .testimonial-block p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .testimonial-attr {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
